<title>BANGLADESH: BANGLADESH TENDERS TO SELL 20,000 T FURNACE OIL.</title>
<headline>BANGLADESH TENDERS TO SELL 20,000 T FURNACE OIL.</headline>
<dateline>DHAKA 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The state-owned Bangladesh Petroleum Corporation (BPC) on Thursday floated a tender to export 20,000 tonnes of high sulphur furnace oil for shipment during September 14-16 period.</p>
<p>The BPC said it would receive offers until 0600 GMT on September 2.</p>
</text>
